{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56169","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 九 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壬申候，高田难保守。\n乘车行渎中，不见吴兴部。\n仓储多偏促，家家无升斗。\n北地遭连厄，九离皆并受。\n兼疫发登莱，平复吴江口。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}